#### 9. General Fixture — `quantityZeroOnUnknownSku`

**Lines 102–105.** The `@BeforeEach` initializes `rng` (line 22), but this test (and most others) never use it. Every test pays setup cost for an unused field.

**Refactor → remove `rng` from `@BeforeEach`; inject it locally in any test that actually needs randomness.

**Risk if unfixed:** Misleading coupling; readers wonder which tests depend on `rng`.

