#### 10. Ignored Test — `disabledTest`

**Lines 108–113.** `@Disabled("flaky, fix later")` — the reason is vague and there is no tracking reference.

**Refactor → either fix the (trivial) test or delete it. If deferring, add a ticket ID:**

