## Smell-Free Patterns ✅

**`addThrowsOnNegativeCount` (lines 117–122)** is exemplary:

- Uses `assertThrows` with a specific exception type
- Asserts on the message content
- Single responsibility — tests exactly one behavior
- No magic numbers, no external resources, no sleeps

This is the pattern the other tests should follow.

